7. Data Extraction Method
The PDF contains line-wrapped transaction records. The extraction process therefore does not assume that every PDF text line represents one complete transaction. PyMuPDF extracts text from all pages, invoice identifiers are used to delimit records, whitespace is normalized, and controlled category and payment values are used to parse the complete record. The resulting extraction produced exactly 500 transaction rows with invoice IDs INV0001 through INV0500.
